---
title: "releaseVestedTokens (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_vesting: check vestingAddress exists
    q_check_vesting --> q_calc_release: vestingAddress != address(0)
    q_check_vesting --> q_revert_no_vesting: no vesting contract
    q_revert_no_vesting --> [*]: revert NoVestingContract
    q_calc_release --> q_check_schedule: calculate releasable amount per schedule
    q_check_schedule --> q_release: releasableAmount > 0
    q_check_schedule --> q_revert_nothing: nothing to release
    q_revert_nothing --> [*]: revert NothingToRelease
    q_release --> [*]: transfer releasable askToken to investor, emit VestedTokensReleased

    note right of q_calc_release
        INV-001: release follows predefined vesting schedule
        INV-002: cumulative released never exceeds total vested allocation
    end note
